// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`costs-generateDisclosure > merges the full disclosure for the band, files it under correspondence and keeps its id 1`] = `
"Costs disclosure
Add your firm’s statement of the client’s rights under “Your rights” before this is given to a client, then delete this note.
Client: Catherine Doyle
Matter: HV-2026-0001  Estate of Margaret Doyle
Date: 6 October 2026
How we will charge
Fee arrangement: Fixed fee
Fixed fee: $4,400.00
Estimate of total legal costs
Our estimate of your total legal costs is the fixed fee of $4,400.00, plus any disbursements.
We will tell you in writing if this estimate changes significantly.
Your rights
[Your firm’s statement of the client’s rights goes here.]

Jordan Price
Senior Associate
Harbour & Vine Legal"
`;

exports[`costs-generateDisclosure > uses the short form below $3,000 1`] = `
"Costs disclosure (short form)
Add your firm’s statement of the client’s rights under “Your rights” before this is given to a client, then delete this note.
Client: Catherine Doyle
Matter: HV-2026-0001  Estate of Margaret Doyle
Date: 6 October 2026
Your total legal costs are not likely to be more than the amount the Uniform General Rules set for this form, so we can give you this short form instead of a full costs disclosure.
Our estimate
Our estimate of your total legal costs is the fixed fee of $2,000.00, plus any disbursements.
Fee arrangement: Fixed fee
Disbursements (such as court fees and searches) and GST are charged as well.
Your rights
[The uniform standard disclosure form’s statement of your rights goes here.]

Jordan Price
Senior Associate
Harbour & Vine Legal"
`;
